{"title":"The Best Shots From the 2026 Aerial Photographer of the Year Contest","link":"https://kottke.org/26/07/the-best-shots-from-the-2026-aerial-photographer-of-the-year-contest","date":1783959060000,"content":"\n         \t<p>The best aerial photography reminds us that we don’t have to go all the way to space to experience a small helping of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overview_effect\">the overview effect</a>. <a href=\"https://www.internationalaerialphotographer.com/index.php\">The 2026 Aerial Photographer of the Year contest</a> celebrates the best photos taken from the air; here are a few of my favorites:</p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950611-521bf972.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950611-521bf972.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950611-521bf972.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950622-da03797d.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950622-da03797d.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950622-da03797d.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950638-41fd8cc4.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950638-41fd8cc4.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950638-41fd8cc4.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950648-66d99d21.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950648-66d99d21.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950648-66d99d21.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950664-eca0524d.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950664-eca0524d.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950664-eca0524d.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950676-d90eaa48.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950676-d90eaa48.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950676-d90eaa48.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950688-c1161f8a.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950688-c1161f8a.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950688-c1161f8a.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950701-f69e4525.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950701-f69e4525.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//plus/misc/images/editor-1783950701-f69e4525.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n\t<p>Photo credits: </p>\n\t<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/paweljagiello_photography?hl=en\">Paweł Jagiełło</a>, Ak-Say Canyon, Kyrgyzstan.</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.azimronnie.com\">Azim Khan Ronnie</a>, a rowing team in Switzerland.</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://teochinleong.com\">Chin Leong Teo</a>, the Park Royal Hotel, Singapore.</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.azimronnie.com\">Azim Khan Ronnie</a>, workers harvesting/drying red chili peppers, Bangladesh.</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.savadmonkphoto.com\">Savadmon Avalachamveettil</a>, the Kumbh Mela pilgrimage crowd, India.</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mrcnzajac\">Marcin Zając</a>, Golden Gate Bridge, San Francisco.</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://teochinleong.com\">Chin Leong Teo</a>, crosswalk in Tokyo.</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/danielvgphoto\">Daniel Viñé Garcia</a>, Cono de Arita, Argentina.</li>\n</ol>\n\t<p>You can see more photos from the winning photographers at <a href=\"https://www.internationalaerialphotographer.com/index.php/archive/2026-awards-book-panels\">the contest’s website</a>, <a href=\"https://www.thisiscolossal.com/2026/07/international-aerial-photographer-of-the-year-contest-2026\">Colossal</a>, <a href=\"https://petapixel.com/2026/07/07/international-aerial-photographer-of-the-year-2026\">PetaPixel</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.diyphotography.net/2026-international-aerial-photographer-of-the-year-winners\">DIY Photography</a>. (via <a href=\"https://www.thisiscolossal.com/2026/07/international-aerial-photographer-of-the-year-contest-2026\">colossal</a>)\n</p>\n \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of\">best of</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/best%20of%202026\">best of 2026</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/drones\">drones</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a></p>\n        \n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee